        A6000 & 91 TFLOPS  & 960 GB/s  & 48 GB & 0.83 \$/h \\
        A40           & 150 TFLOPS  & 696 GB/s  & 48 GB  & 0.55 \$/h \\
        L40          & 181 TFLOPS  & 864 GB/s  & 48 GB  & 0.83 \$/h \\
        A100          & 312 TFLOPS   & 1555 GB/s & 80 GB  & 1.75 \$/h \\
        H100          & 1979 TFLOPS & 3.35 TB/s & 80 GB  & 2.99 \$/h \\
